      "description": "Vapour flashed from the hot digested slurry (multi-stage flash) is condensed in these heaters to preheat the incoming slurry — recovering most of the heat. Desilication product scale (sodalite) and titanate deposits build up inside the tubes and cut heat transfer, so heaters are taken off-line for descaling (hydro-blasting or acid) in rotation.",
